      "source": "For example, if the inputs are `puppy.jpg` and [`image`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UniformTypeIdentifiers/UTType-swift.struct/image), respectively, the function returns a URL with an appended path component of `puppy.jpg`.",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, if the inputs are `puppy.jpg` and [`image`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UniformTypeIdentifiers/UTType-swift.struct/image), respectively, the function returns a URL with an appended path component of `puppy.jpg`.",
